+# Support ZEC Private
+
+Donations help fund development and maintenance. They are optional.
+
+Tap the hand-and-heart icon on Home, or open **Settings → More → Support development** to donate shielded ZEC. Enter an amount, optionally add a message, and review the payment before sending.
+
+You can also donate using the addresses below. Check the asset, network and destination before sending.
+
+## Zcash (ZEC)
+
+Zcash mainnet. Use a wallet that supports Orchard shielded payments.
+
+```text
+u16hcm5ln6c9yvj7snd3k2m9s5zlg2hntnqupzpl7r7xxqf23pf9dze7ja6782kjc454pu2kamk0xawul5zv9arugr797xfse385cgjmar
+```
+
+![Zcash donation address](donations/zec-address.png)
+
+## Monero (XMR)
+
+Monero mainnet. Send from a Monero wallet.
+
+```text
+83Jji8QKKhRdeLZ6nALJaQhACiAMZ1MNZiFCwkTToD7KWEN3cCg8ePDbBRR6j7LM23gFttMQmSH9zUpbkn6N5pFxA6r9KtA
+```
+
+![Monero donation address](donations/xmr-address.png)
